'''Sant Llàtzer International Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport Internacional de Sant Llàtzer}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: SLZ, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: SLIB) is an international airport serving [[Sant Llàtzer]], the capital of [[Migjorn Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is located in the [[El Delta]] comarca on the [[Aethiopian Ocean]] coast and serves as the Aethiopian terminus of the [[Balboa Canal|canal]]. It is the third-busiest airport in Balboa by passenger volume. The airport handles both domestic and international traffic, with [[Sinchew Air]] operating services to [[Tamsui]] and [[Aeroístmus]] serving the airport from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

